{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>YHWH will reign.</b> When the Temple is built for His name, then you will see His kingship on earth." "And the meaning of לעולם ועד is by way of abbreviation, for it is לעולם ועד עולם. Do not wonder on account of the word עד that it is not in construct state, for it is written שוכן עד וקדוש שמו (Isaiah 57:15). And the rule of the sacred language is that when the vowel is in the letter following vav, they open it [with a patach], like שור וכשב ועז (Leviticus 7:23), and because of this ועד was opened [with a patach]. Now, he said ואֹכַל מכל (Genesis 27:33), and at the end of the verse, הנחש השיאני וָאֹכֵל (ibid. 3:13). Therefore they said לעלם ועד."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:49.799409919Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}